lines.text:
God has blessed us with every spiritual blessing in heavenly places in Christ (  Eph.1:3
). Our Christian life must begin with what God has done. We love Him because He first loved us. We serve Him, because He    first served us. God knew us before the creation of the world ( Eph.1:4 
). We can't understand that because we have past, present and future, whereas God's Name is "I AM" (  Exod.3:14  ). God lives in an eternal present. So He knew each of us by name long before He created anything. He placed us in Christ even before the worlds were created.
